{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880420/extras/472cafcdca34da803765b1564453f430.poster.avif?t=1762012889\" width=800 height=229 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880420/extras/472cafcdca34da803765b1564453f430.webm?t=1762012889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ALL IN A FLICK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You are Jimmy Flickerman, an agoraphobic young man living with his father in their family-run shop. Unable to leave due to your condition, your days pass by helping your father and playing video games. But when your father suddenly takes a short trip, everything changes in a flick. Now, the entire shop and every... single... task... falls on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880420/extras/1ee8804ebd9889e45274a5c0cc3258b1.poster.avif?t=1762012889\" width=1170 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880420/extras/1ee8804ebd9889e45274a5c0cc3258b1.webm?t=1762012889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880420/extras/1ee8804ebd9889e45274a5c0cc3258b1.mp4?t=1762012889\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WAKE UP</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And check your e-mails. Feed your fish. Manage the store and handle your... lovely customers. Spend your days searching for answers: Where did your father go? Why is everything like this? What\u2019s going on? And most importantly... is any of this real?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880420/extras/68113e89701f489b45bf650b4e6afeb2.poster.avif?t=1762012889\" width=1170 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880420/extras/68113e89701f489b45bf650b4e6afeb2.webm?t=1762012889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880420/extras/68113e89701f489b45bf650b4e6afeb2.mp4?t=1762012889\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DAY AND NIGHT</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By day, spend your time dealing with the customers and fixing their consoles before calling it a night. By night, delve into the depths of your mind and rest up to face a new day. Stay safe and... stay sane.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880420/extras/60fbb78a12d39a1b92dbd9402c78f7e4.poster.avif?t=1762012889\" width=1170 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880420/extras/60fbb78a12d39a1b92dbd9402c78f7e4.webm?t=1762012889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880420/extras/60fbb78a12d39a1b92dbd9402c78f7e4.mp4?t=1762012889\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY\u00a0FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience an immersive first-person narrative in a unique business simulation setting.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade, repair, and assemble vintage game consoles.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bargain prices with customers, navigating the ever-changing market.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your business and increase your renown in the community.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet curious minds and uncover their hidden thoughts.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together a mysterious story through introspective inner monologues.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore your workplace like you\u2019re exploring your own mind.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed and care for your pet fish. (THE MOST IMPORTANT ONE!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage everything from the comfort and safety of your cozy little store.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3880420?t=1762012889","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880420/3c9c6c1122f77f61969fbb58de0cda6784ead2ad/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762012889","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880420/69e895eebef184b0fb5a7c4212e56afa7d8a92c2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762012889","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880420/69e895eebef184b0fb5a7c4212e56afa7d8a92c2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762012889","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880420/extras/472cafcdca34da803765b1564453f430.poster.avif?t=1762012889\" width=800 heigh